#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To get information about a qubit's state, you can _measure_ it onto a [classical bit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Clbit). In Qiskit, measurements are performed in the computational basis, that is, the single-qubit Pauli-$Z$ basis. Therefore, a measurement yields 0 or 1, depending on the overlap with the Pauli-$Z$ eigenstates $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$:\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Para makakuha ng impormasyon tungkol sa estado ng isang qubit, maaari mo itong _sukatin_ sa isang [classical bit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Clbit). Sa Qiskit, ang mga sukat ay isinasagawa sa computational basis, ibig sabihin, ang single-qubit Pauli-$Z$ basis. Kaya naman, ang isang sukat ay nagbubunga ng 0 o 1, depende sa overlap sa mga Pauli-$Z$ eigenstate na $|0\\rangle$ at $|1\\rangle$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|q\\rangle \\xrightarrow{measure}\\begin{cases}\n"
"      0 (\\text{outcome}+1), \\text{with probability } p_0=|\\langle q|0\\rangle|^{2}\\text{,} \\\\\n"
"      1 (\\text{outcome}-1), \\text{with probability } p_1=|\\langle q|1\\rangle|^{2}\\text{.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|q\\rangle \\xrightarrow{measure}\\begin{cases}\n"
"      0 (\\text{outcome}+1), \\text{with probability } p_0=|\\langle q|0\\rangle|^{2}\\text{,} \\\\\n"
"      1 (\\text{outcome}-1), \\text{with probability } p_1=|\\langle q|1\\rangle|^{2}\\text{.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a measurement to a circuit {#apply-a-measurement-to-a-circuit}"
msgstr ""
"Mag-apply ng sukat sa isang circuit {#apply-a-measurement-to-a-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to apply measurements to a circuit:\n"
msgstr "Mayroong ilang paraan para mag-apply ng mga sukat sa isang circuit:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-method}"
msgstr "Paraan ng `QuantumCircuit.measure` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure)"
" method to measure a "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-"
"class).\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang paraan ng "
"[`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure)"
" para sukatin ang isang "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-"
"class).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Examples:\n"
msgstr "Mga halimbawa:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`Measure` class {#measure-class}"
msgstr "Klase ng `Measure` {#measure-class}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit "
"[Measure](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure)"
" class measures the specified qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Qiskit "
"[Measure](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure)"
" class ay sumusukat sa mga tinukoy na qubit.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QuantumCircuit.measure_all` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-all-method}"
msgstr ""
"Paraan ng `QuantumCircuit.measure_all` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-all-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To measure all qubits into the corresponding classical bits, use the "
"[`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all)"
" method. By default, this method adds new classical bits in a "
"`ClassicalRegister` to store these measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sukatin ang lahat ng qubit sa kaukulang mga classical bit, gamitin ang "
"paraan ng "
"[`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all)."
" Sa default, ang paraang ito ay nagdadagdag ng mga bagong classical bit sa "
"isang `ClassicalRegister` para maimbak ang mga sukat na ito.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QuantumCircuit.measure_active` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-active-"
"method}"
msgstr ""
"Paraan ng `QuantumCircuit.measure_active` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-active-"
"method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To measure all qubits that are not idle, use the "
"[`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active)"
" method. This method creates a new `ClassicalRegister` with a size equal to "
"the number of non-idle qubits being measured.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sukatin ang lahat ng qubit na hindi idle, gamitin ang paraan ng "
"[`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active)."
" Ang paraang ito ay lumilikha ng bagong `ClassicalRegister` na may laki na "
"katumbas ng bilang ng mga qubit na hindi idle na sinusukat.\n"

